# 🛡️ Cybersecurity Lab — Local & Cloud Setup

> **Status:** 🟡 Planned — Practical implementation pending access to a suitable PC or authorized cloud environment.

## 🎯 Overview

This project is a planned cybersecurity practice laboratory designed for hands-on learning in both **offensive and defensive security**.

The lab will use **Kali Linux** as the attacker machine and intentionally vulnerable targets such as **DVWA, OWASP Juice Shop, and Metasploitable**.

The environment can be deployed locally using virtualization software or in an authorized cloud environment.

---

## 🏗️ Lab Architecture

```text
                 Kali Linux
                (Attacker)
                    │
                    │
          Isolated Lab Network
                    │
        ┌───────────┼───────────┐
        │           │           │
       DVWA    OWASP Juice   Metasploitable
                 Shop
        │
        └──────── Vulnerable Targets

        Optional Defensive Environment
        ├── Sysmon
        ├── Splunk Free
        └── ELK Stack
```

The lab network will be configured using **Host-Only** or **Internal Network** mode to keep testing traffic isolated from the normal network.

